<title>USA: Scandinavian Broadcast to boost TV Norge.</title>
<headline>Scandinavian Broadcast to boost TV Norge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Broadcasting System SA said it plans to increase its distribution for TV Norge to 75 percent of Norwegian television households in 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said it will post improved market-share in Norway by the end of the year, although did not provide specific details.</p>
<p>The company added that it will convert its Copenhagen station into a national over-the-air network in 1997.</p>
<p>That will allow it to increase its Denmark penetration to 80 percent, the company said.</p>
</text>
